ly reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StrictLinearOrder}(J,&lt;)\">\\(\\operatorname{StrictLinearOrder}(J,&lt;)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:J\\to|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(a:J\\to|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ind}_{J,&lt;}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ind}_{J,&lt;}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> 及其有序索引输入取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9c54640eb3282127\" href=\"?note=9c54640eb3282127\" title=\"17-df-indiscernible-sequence\">17-df-indiscernible-sequence</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Indisc}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Indisc}_L\\)</span> 是下面给出的谓词记法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Indisc}_L(\\mathfrak A,J,&lt;,a)\n\\leftrightarrow a\\in\\operatorname{Ind}_{J,&lt;}(\\mathfrak A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Indisc}_L(\\mathfrak A,J,&lt;,a)\n\\leftrightarrow a\\in\\operatorname{Ind}_{J,&lt;}(\\mathfrak A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The canonical predicate compares increasing tuples of the same finite length.\nIt does not compare arbitrary finite tuples of different lengths or with\ndifferent equality/order patterns.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-indiscernible-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"9c54640eb3282127","anchor":"